```mermaid
graph TD
    classDef contract fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef event fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    
    subgraph Core Contracts
        AS[AbstractSwing]:::contract
        AST[AbstractStructure]:::contract
        AL[AbstractLiquidity]:::contract
        AI[AbstractImbalance]:::contract
        AZ[AbstractZone]:::contract
    end

    subgraph Data Flow
        D[(OHLCV Dataset)] --> SE[Swing Engine]
        
        SE -->|Swing Event| Swing[Swing: High/Low]:::event
        
        Swing --> STR[Structure Engine]
        STR -->|Structure Event| BOS[BOS/CHOCH/MSS]:::event
        
        Swing --> LIQ[Liquidity Engine]
        LIQ -->|Liquidity Event| LP[Liquidity Pool: EQH/EQL]:::event
        
        D --> IMB[Imbalance Engine]
        IMB -->|Imbalance Event| FVG[FVG/Volume Imb]:::event
        
        Swing --> ZE[Zone Engine]
        ZE -->|Zone Event| ZONE[Premium/Discount/Eq]:::event
        
        BOS --> CE[Conflict Engine]
        CE -->|Conflict Event| CONFLICT[MTF Conflict]:::event
    end
    
    subgraph Persistence & Audit
        Swing --> GS[(Geometry Store)]
        BOS --> GS
        LP --> GS
        FVG --> GS
        ZONE --> GS
        CONFLICT --> GS
        
        GS --> TRACE[Traceability Validator]
    end
```
